Keep video decoders' counters current in the guest's syncpoint table. The table starts as
Unallocated and a counter is refreshed only when the guest requests it; nn::syncpt reads Unallocated
as reached. OoT's movie::VideoDecoder::Flush releases and re-acquires frames for as long as the head
frame's fence is reached, so with the decoder's counter never requested it looped forever and New
Game hung (found by disassembling subsdk0 and the sdk). A released image's fence is then unreached
after a flush, as on the console, and the loop ends. Applies to every title;
/data/eden-nx2/video-counter-table-off.txt turns it off.

